Iron Muscles is a monk discipline that develops extraordinary muscular
strength through specialized conditioning. The monk's muscles become
dense and powerful, capable of feats that belie their lean appearance.

This passive skill provides a strength bonus that increases with your
skill level. The enhanced muscle density allows monks to strike harder,
carry more, and perform feats of strength that surprise those who
underestimate their wiry frames.

Iron Muscles complements the monk's other combat abilities, adding raw
power to their precision strikes.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Iron Body

See Also: IRON SKIN, IRON BONES, IRON FLESH, IRON LEGS
